flowchart TD
F[Forward saves Q K V O and row statistics] --> D[Compute D from dO and O]
D --> S[Recompute score tile on chip]
S --> P[Recover probability tile with global statistics]
P --> V[Accumulate dV]
P --> G[Compute dP then dS]
G --> Q[Accumulate dQ and dK]
V --> H[Write gradients to HBM]
Q --> H